{"time_ns": 1794061640325745000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 18, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "6de1c7d40aae8c431500664bf637eaea0d153914b621af79a2205748599d7cb1", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Executive Summary\nAnalysis of regional transaction data completed successfully for all 24 records (R001-R024).\n\n## Data Overview\n- **Total Records:** 24\n- **Regions Analyzed:** North, South, West\n- **Reporting Currency:** Cents\n\n## Regional Breakdown\n\n| Region | Total Amount (cents) | Total Amount (dollars) |\n|--------|---------------------|----------------------|\n| North  | 232,878              | $2,328.78             |\n| South  | 492,527              | $4,925.27             |\n| West   | 458,193              | $4,581.93             |\n| **TOTAL** | **1,183,598**      | **$11,835.98**        |\n\n## Key Findings\n- South region has the highest total at $4,925.27 (41.6% of total)\n- West region is second at $4,581.93 (38.7% of total)  \n- North region totals $2,328.78 (19.7% of total)\n- All 24 records accounted for and verified\n\n## Status\n✅ **COMPLETED** - All records processed successfully with verified regional totals.\n", "ok": true}
